│ unnecessary conversion and maintains         │
│ compatibility with existing query logic.     │
│ The PickledField dependency suggests this is │
│ a critical issue for data integrity.         │
│                                              │
│                                              │
│  # modification 1                            │
│  [file]src/core/query/query.py[/file]        │
│  [original]def resolve_lookup_value(self,    │
│  value):\n    if isinstance(value, list):\n  │
│  value = tuple(value)\n    return            │
│  value[/original]                            │
│  [patched]def resolve_lookup_value(self,     │
│  value):\n    if isinstance(value, list):\n  │
